		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A gigantic blooming lotus that consumes corpses. Its pollen is a preservative. Mindless, dangerous.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 vine (near) +5 (1d8 + engulf) and digest corpse, <strong>MV</strong> close, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Digest Corpse</strong>. Pull corpse within near into bloom and consume it. Regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Engulf</strong>. If a target is hit by two or more vines in same round, it is pulled into lotus's blossom and suffocates. STR 15+ on turn to escape. If target dies, automatically digested.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
